    "factsheet": [
        {
            "heading": "General",
            "paragraphs": [
                "We learn about the history of the area over the past 500 years and how there has been a constant arrival of people from various cultures . \nThe tour refers historically to establishments that have been feeding the population for many decades as well as supplying drinks  , evolving as necessary with the times but at the same time keeping certain traditions and history . \nWe also pass by some  places which have since closed but discuss their history and influence . ."
            ]
        },
        {
            "heading": "Golden Key Academy",
            "paragraphs": [
                "This tour is led by an alumnus of Open City’s Golden Key Academy - an eight-month course designed to train insightful and engaging guides who bring London’s rich stories to life.\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\nLearn more about the Golden Key Academy here: open-city.org.uk/golden-key-academy"
